WEBVTT

00:03.680 --> 00:06.480
I guess that's all these NPCs got.

00:08.480 --> 00:13.480
I'm sick of playing against bots.
I want to do some PVP.

00:15.750 --> 00:21.160
It looks like the ones I made
aren't much fun for you anymore.

00:21.640 --> 00:24.000
I have another fun game for you.

00:24.280 --> 00:25.800
Wanna try it?

02:02.030 --> 02:02.770
Oh?

02:02.770 --> 02:03.880
Eh?

02:03.880 --> 02:05.010
What the?

02:05.010 --> 02:06.140
Gobo?

02:06.140 --> 02:07.650
What now?

02:24.630 --> 02:26.250
Everybody up!

02:28.850 --> 02:30.040
Where are we?

02:30.590 --> 02:32.000
I don't know.

02:32.000 --> 02:34.480
This obviously isn't normal.

02:34.480 --> 02:37.040
I thought we were on our way to Akiba.

02:37.040 --> 02:39.490
Gobo gobo gobobo gobo?

02:37.640 --> 02:39.490
"Weren't we in an underground river?"

02:39.490 --> 02:41.100
I got that message from Nick...

02:41.100 --> 02:43.550
And we were going to use magic...

02:46.370 --> 02:48.320
Gobobo gobo gobo!

02:46.370 --> 02:48.320
Otaku Hero-sama!

02:51.830 --> 02:54.810
Gobo... bo gobobo.

02:55.320 --> 02:56.140
Blue!

02:56.140 --> 02:57.070
Pink-chan!

02:58.950 --> 03:00.120
Gobo gobo.

03:00.120 --> 03:02.760
This is such sloppy bondage!

03:02.760 --> 03:04.700
Blue-chan! Pink-chan!

03:04.700 --> 03:06.680
What's happening?

03:06.680 --> 03:11.280
<i>Welcome to my world. Let's start the game!</i>

03:12.960 --> 03:21.470
Kyotaro

03:12.960 --> 03:21.470
Anarchy

03:12.960 --> 03:21.470
Otaku Hero

03:13.210 --> 03:14.920
An SSC cofficer appeared!

03:15.000 --> 03:16.380
Cofficer uses a combo attack.

03:15.280 --> 03:16.920
What the heck is this?

03:17.630 --> 03:18.710
Critical hit!

03:17.630 --> 03:19.110
Oh, come on!

03:22.790 --> 03:24.720
It's just like a game!

03:28.720 --> 03:29.730
Kyotaro

03:28.720 --> 03:29.730
Anarchy

03:28.720 --> 03:29.730
Otaku Hero

03:28.850 --> 03:29.730
Anarchy takes 16 damage!

03:30.730 --> 03:31.730
Kyotaro

03:30.730 --> 03:31.730
Anarchy

03:30.730 --> 03:31.730
Otaku Hero

03:30.850 --> 03:31.730
Otaku Hero takes 20 damage!

03:32.730 --> 03:47.240
Kyotaro

03:32.730 --> 03:47.240
Anarchy

03:32.730 --> 03:47.240
Otaku Hero

03:33.580 --> 03:36.260
Hey, I lost a life!

03:35.810 --> 03:36.400
Fight
Run

03:36.840 --> 03:38.020
Take that!

03:39.050 --> 03:40.850
You gotta be kidding!

03:40.850 --> 03:42.400
I'll do it, then.

03:43.780 --> 03:47.240
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

03:43.780 --> 03:47.240
Critical hit!

The cofficer was defeated.

03:47.240 --> 03:50.000
I guess you can handle that much.

03:47.490 --> 03:50.660
<b>I guess you can handle that much.</b>

03:52.490 --> 03:55.490
I'm from SSC.
One of the Four Heavenly Kings.

03:55.710 --> 03:56.750
Adam!

03:56.930 --> 03:58.030
SSC!

03:58.240 --> 04:00.630
What have you done
with Blue-chan and Pink-chan?!

04:00.630 --> 04:04.380
Games are more fun
when there's a prize, right?

04:04.380 --> 04:08.640
I thought you could fight me
and try to win them back.

04:08.640 --> 04:10.470
What are you talking about?

04:10.470 --> 04:13.960
Yeah, so let's get to it!

04:14.640 --> 04:15.890
Who's that?

04:15.890 --> 04:17.150
Another one?

04:21.280 --> 04:24.320
None of you guys have
any conversation skills.

04:24.320 --> 04:25.480
Transf—

04:25.810 --> 04:27.200
What? I can't?

04:29.210 --> 04:31.360
This is my world!

04:31.360 --> 04:33.920
You're completely powerless here.

04:33.920 --> 04:37.460
You can drown in the program in my head!

04:41.100 --> 04:42.730
Damn it!

04:48.320 --> 04:49.440
Anarchy-chan!

04:51.810 --> 04:53.180
What a noob.

04:53.180 --> 04:56.180
And you're the leader of the insurgent army?

04:57.110 --> 04:57.940
Oh, no!

04:59.320 --> 05:00.000
Ouch!

05:00.000 --> 05:01.440
Otaku Hero!

05:01.700 --> 05:04.040
Stop using me as a shield!

05:07.990 --> 05:10.090
What did I just tell you?

05:14.050 --> 05:16.260
Anarchy-chan! You okay?

05:16.670 --> 05:18.660
That might've killed you.

05:18.660 --> 05:20.620
It did kill me!

05:20.620 --> 05:24.140
And what the hell? My lives are limited now?

05:24.140 --> 05:25.890
Zero lives left?!

05:25.890 --> 05:29.040
Huh, the magical girl's carrying you.

05:29.040 --> 05:31.130
You take the magical girl.

05:31.130 --> 05:33.640
I'm more interested in the guy.

05:33.640 --> 05:35.390
Understood.

05:36.800 --> 05:38.300
Anarchy-chan?

05:38.580 --> 05:40.020
What do you think you're doing?

05:40.020 --> 05:41.220
Otaku Hero.

05:41.220 --> 05:45.300
Carried and cuddled by magical girls,
while leading the insurgent army?

05:45.300 --> 05:46.780
You aren't such a big deal.

05:47.000 --> 05:49.780
Blue-chan and Pink-chan better be all right!

05:50.080 --> 05:50.730
Heh.

05:50.730 --> 05:54.280
Maybe you should spend a second
worrying about yourself instead.

05:54.620 --> 05:56.960
Why did you bring us here?

05:56.960 --> 05:58.340
Isn't it great?

05:58.340 --> 06:00.800
This world is just the way I want it.

06:00.800 --> 06:02.800
Everything is a game here.

06:02.800 --> 06:06.430
And crushing the Revolutionary
Army will be a breeze.

06:06.710 --> 06:09.080
What's so good about SSC anyway?

06:09.470 --> 06:13.330
You can't like what you want to.
That's messed up.

06:13.330 --> 06:17.070
That Unit-@ guy was brainwashed.
I bet you are, too.

06:17.070 --> 06:19.480
Quit bitching about your stupid dreams!

06:23.440 --> 06:26.720
I was gonna become a pro gamer.

06:27.190 --> 06:29.490
The age of video games is just starting.

06:29.490 --> 06:32.200
Gamers are going to take over the world.

06:32.200 --> 06:37.200
I can't waste any time practicing.
I can do anything I want with hacks!

06:37.200 --> 06:40.200
Yeah! I'm dominating!

06:40.500 --> 06:44.320
All these self-righteous, weak tryhards
who are too afraid to use cheats,

06:44.320 --> 06:46.360
I'll kill them all!

06:49.460 --> 06:51.880
Damn noobs can't touch me!

06:52.720 --> 06:53.470
Account Closed
This account has been permanently disabled

06:53.480 --> 06:56.600
Huh? I got banned? But why?!

06:57.680 --> 07:00.360
Damn it! I can't log in here, either.

07:00.630 --> 07:04.360
Here I am trying to spread
the joy of gaming around the world.

07:04.360 --> 07:06.360
Why are you kicking me out?

07:07.070 --> 07:08.110
Error
This account has been terminated!

07:07.070 --> 07:08.110
Continue

07:07.070 --> 07:09.110
Here? There? This one, too?

07:09.440 --> 07:12.780
Every one of them?!

07:09.570 --> 07:10.610
Error
This account has been terminated!

07:09.570 --> 07:10.610
Continue

07:11.610 --> 07:12.360
Account Closed
This account has been permanently disabled.

07:14.880 --> 07:16.120
Why though?!

07:16.120 --> 07:19.770
I'm the one! I'm the elite gamer!

07:19.770 --> 07:22.120
I should be allowed to use hacks!

07:22.120 --> 07:28.500
I was the first person ever to show
the world how talented gamers are!

07:36.640 --> 07:41.130
So why, then? Why are they rejecting me?

07:42.890 --> 07:45.320
Don't you want power?

07:45.320 --> 07:51.630
The wonderful power to make
everything go exactly the way you want?

07:52.600 --> 07:54.150
Who are you?

07:54.440 --> 08:00.830
If you swear your loyalty to me,
I will give you that power.

08:21.010 --> 08:26.190
That's how I was able to create
the ideal world in my mind.

08:26.190 --> 08:29.330
I got a partner named Eve.

08:30.900 --> 08:33.060
You chose to join SSC yourself?

08:33.060 --> 08:36.640
Did you think we were all
brainwashed or something?

08:36.640 --> 08:40.200
I decided that I would do anything I had to

08:40.200 --> 08:42.750
to prove that justice was on my side!

08:44.210 --> 08:45.340
Here I come!

08:47.330 --> 08:50.080
How dare you look down on people like that?!

08:59.270 --> 09:01.360
You're messing with stuff again!

09:05.960 --> 09:09.950
Without your magic, you're nothing
but a foul-mouthed tramp.

09:10.800 --> 09:12.480
I'm so gonna beat you up.

09:13.790 --> 09:14.820
Not again!

09:15.590 --> 09:17.570
Hey! I'm on my last life!

09:23.360 --> 09:25.210
What the hell? Damn it!

09:25.210 --> 09:28.200
You're helpless in this world.

09:28.200 --> 09:30.070
Try to die gracefully.

09:30.070 --> 09:31.700
I've got continues, baby!

09:39.180 --> 09:40.100
<b>Fantasy Blocker Switch</b>

09:43.010 --> 09:45.360
Does that rocket launcher
have infinite ammo?!

09:45.360 --> 09:50.600
In this environment, I can
spawn any power I can imagine.

09:51.080 --> 09:52.850
You're such a cheater!

09:53.180 --> 09:55.940
I'm connected to all of you.

09:55.940 --> 10:01.510
In this world, I also can spawn anything
inside your head with a single thought.

10:01.510 --> 10:02.870
Godeen!

10:02.870 --> 10:05.870
Get rekt by your own imagination!

10:08.750 --> 10:10.080
What a powerful attack!

10:10.080 --> 10:13.510
No wonder Godeen was able to
save the whole planet!

10:17.850 --> 10:19.160
Damn it.

10:19.160 --> 10:23.670
The only one that could ever take
on Godeen is probably Yunboger G.

10:23.670 --> 10:25.490
But he's not here...

10:25.490 --> 10:26.350
Huh?

10:27.520 --> 10:28.860
Yunboger?

10:30.190 --> 10:33.100
<i>He and I are connected
in this imaginary world, right?</i>

10:33.100 --> 10:34.420
<i>Then, maybe I can...</i>

10:35.980 --> 10:36.880
Ha!

10:36.880 --> 10:39.620
You think you can do something like this?

10:40.320 --> 10:41.850
I should be able to.

10:42.340 --> 10:47.630
We otaku can take just the tiniest
sliver of information to imagine,

10:47.630 --> 10:51.500
fantasize, create, and have fun on our own!

10:51.630 --> 10:55.640
And when it's something
that already exists, we can do even more!

10:56.120 --> 10:57.880
Wh-What?!

11:18.230 --> 11:20.300
I've always wanted to try that.

11:20.300 --> 11:22.240
Super Galactic Construction Equipment

11:22.240 --> 11:26.870
Yunboger G!

11:26.870 --> 11:27.920
What did you say?!

11:27.920 --> 11:32.270
When it comes to imagination and fantasy,
you'll never beat an otaku!

11:38.130 --> 11:39.530
What's that?

11:44.770 --> 11:47.260
<i>Did I get through? Anarchy-chan, you okay?</i>

11:47.260 --> 11:49.670
Otaku Hero, what is happening?

11:49.670 --> 11:53.190
<i>Right now we're inside
a cyberspace that he created.</i>

11:53.190 --> 11:54.660
So what do we do?

11:54.660 --> 11:56.750
<i>As long as we're connected to them,</i>

11:56.750 --> 11:59.530
<i>we should be able to use
the power of imagination, too!</i>

11:59.860 --> 12:03.720
No kidding. So if we think
we can do it, we can?

12:04.410 --> 12:05.610
Transform.

12:07.520 --> 12:09.160
Transforming won't help you.

12:12.820 --> 12:15.290
Okay. I can do this. I can do this!

12:15.500 --> 12:18.120
I think I owe you one from before.

12:20.040 --> 12:23.760
Die, die, diedie, diedie, diedie, die!

12:26.050 --> 12:28.080
I can even stop a black hole.

12:28.080 --> 12:30.940
Your attack has no effect on Yunboger G!

12:31.290 --> 12:34.250
According to canon,
nothing on Earth can destroy him!

12:34.250 --> 12:36.190
What kind of canon is that?!

12:36.190 --> 12:37.060
Here I go!

12:41.430 --> 12:43.980
Now I'll show you
the finishing attack that was

12:43.980 --> 12:48.200
supposed to be revealed
in the uncompleted movie version!

12:49.450 --> 12:52.490
To be sure it hits the target, lock on!

12:52.830 --> 12:53.590
Wha—!

12:53.590 --> 12:55.340
And then this!

12:55.880 --> 13:02.250
The lost movie version
Cozmo Hydraulic Tornado Attack!

13:13.640 --> 13:16.480
What the hell?!
This guy is using hacks, too?!

13:16.480 --> 13:18.130
It isn't a hack!

13:18.130 --> 13:20.720
It bulldozes all of
the misconstructions of the past

13:20.720 --> 13:23.860
and erects a bridge leading into the future.

13:23.860 --> 13:26.200
It's the spirit of justice!

13:26.200 --> 13:29.590
Fixing all misconstructions
is what you call justice?

13:29.590 --> 13:31.490
That's just another cheat!

13:32.950 --> 13:34.460
All right, all right.

13:34.460 --> 13:36.590
All right, all right,
all right, all right, all right!

13:36.590 --> 13:38.840
You're the glass cannon type, huh?

13:39.120 --> 13:40.650
Shut up!

13:46.590 --> 13:48.100
You're lagging!

13:50.090 --> 13:51.820
Let's see you handle this!

13:55.390 --> 13:56.390
I got her!

13:58.160 --> 14:00.400
Sh-She got me...

14:00.400 --> 14:01.890
I didn't get her?

14:01.890 --> 14:03.270
Game...

14:03.270 --> 14:05.690
Over!

14:09.400 --> 14:11.160
Yeah, give it up!

14:11.890 --> 14:14.520
Eve, we end this now.

14:25.180 --> 14:27.030
Here he comes, Otaku Hero!

14:27.030 --> 14:27.760
Yeah!

14:33.280 --> 14:36.400
Damn it! He's moving so fast,
I can't get a clear shot!

14:36.400 --> 14:38.640
I'll try to slow him down.

14:39.950 --> 14:41.140
Heaven's...

14:43.740 --> 14:45.270
Damn it!

14:45.560 --> 14:48.020
Always pulling sneaky shit!

14:52.580 --> 14:54.290
I'm stuck in sludge!

14:54.290 --> 14:56.430
Damn it! Engine at full power!

14:58.280 --> 14:59.390
Oh, no!

14:59.390 --> 15:02.290
Did I use up all the energy
with the special attack?

15:02.290 --> 15:06.530
I recreated him so perfectly I even
kept his one weak point. Poor mileage!

15:06.530 --> 15:10.560
Damn it! Move! Please move for me, Yunboger!

15:10.560 --> 15:13.810
You like that one? This is what it's like
when I don't hold back!

15:13.810 --> 15:16.810
Don't get so cocky when
you're playing on controller!

15:21.400 --> 15:23.480
Do you have eyes in the back of your head?

15:26.650 --> 15:29.950
Okay, that hurt.

15:29.950 --> 15:32.040
Damn it! Eat this!

15:33.480 --> 15:34.920
Then try to block this!

15:35.440 --> 15:36.780
Eh? Really?

15:36.780 --> 15:39.540
Heaven's Heat Knock!

15:43.280 --> 15:44.160
You can't be serious!

15:50.170 --> 15:53.270
No way! This is supposed to be my world!

15:53.270 --> 15:54.060
Hey!

15:54.430 --> 15:57.920
Looks like you can't do
a damn thing without her help.

15:57.920 --> 15:58.720
Huh?

16:00.760 --> 16:01.800
Eve!

16:01.800 --> 16:03.800
Now's your chance, Otaku Hero!

16:03.800 --> 16:04.920
Go for it!

16:04.920 --> 16:06.180
Oh, wow.

16:06.180 --> 16:07.950
There's a g-girl cheering me on?

16:07.960 --> 16:10.570
The same situation happened in episode 256!

16:10.570 --> 16:11.850
In that case...!

16:14.080 --> 16:17.080
We will always rise to fight again!

16:17.880 --> 16:20.080
Go for it, Otaku Hero!

16:20.080 --> 16:22.080
Go!

16:22.080 --> 16:24.700
Finish them off, Otaku Hero!

16:24.700 --> 16:28.710
In that case, I'll take
the magical girl for myself!

16:31.400 --> 16:32.690
Anarchy-chan!

16:33.340 --> 16:33.960
Yes!

16:33.340 --> 16:33.960
Yes!

16:33.960 --> 16:35.850
Begin brainwashing!

16:40.590 --> 16:42.120
Anarchy-chan?

16:58.620 --> 16:59.760
Ow!

17:00.500 --> 17:02.280
What just happened?

17:02.280 --> 17:06.120
I don't know,
but something felt really wrong.

17:06.120 --> 17:07.380
Felt wrong?

17:10.800 --> 17:14.300
What did you put inside us?
What did you do to us?!

17:17.330 --> 17:19.550
I can't look at that!

17:19.970 --> 17:27.110
Becoming this, doing this,
is what I was always programmed for?

17:28.440 --> 17:29.440
Eve!

17:34.100 --> 17:36.290
E-Eve!

17:40.160 --> 17:44.590
Damn it! Is this it?
The end of my ideal world?

17:48.720 --> 17:51.440
Oh, crap! We need to get out of here!

17:51.440 --> 17:53.340
But what about Blue and Pink?

17:53.340 --> 17:56.460
Of course, we have to find them first!

17:57.920 --> 17:59.180
What's this?

18:00.750 --> 18:01.540
Let's go!

18:01.540 --> 18:02.420
Yeah.

18:07.210 --> 18:08.610
Gobobo.

18:09.150 --> 18:13.020
Wait! Not right there! Stop it!

18:14.080 --> 18:15.060
Blue-chan?

18:14.080 --> 18:15.060
Pink?

18:15.060 --> 18:19.810
I use a Draw Two and she drops all
the Draw Fours on me? She's a monster!

18:17.780 --> 18:19.820
<b>*House Rules in Effect</b>

18:21.320 --> 18:23.860
Hi, guys. You sure are late.

18:23.860 --> 18:25.330
Gobo gobo bobobo.

18:25.330 --> 18:27.330
"Do you want to join the game?" She said.

18:27.330 --> 18:29.120
Quit playing games inside the enemy's head!

18:29.120 --> 18:30.470
Be more scared!

18:30.470 --> 18:33.710
B-But we're glad you're okay.

18:34.020 --> 18:35.720
This world is ending.

18:35.720 --> 18:37.680
Let's get out of here quick.

18:51.350 --> 18:53.210
My whole body aches.

18:53.210 --> 18:54.230
Where are we?

18:54.230 --> 18:56.240
Gobo gobobo?

18:56.240 --> 18:58.160
It looks like we made it back.

18:58.160 --> 19:01.130
Yeah. I'm glad we're all okay.

19:01.620 --> 19:02.750
There's somebody here!

19:05.730 --> 19:07.000
Hmm.

19:07.000 --> 19:09.750
I guess I should take the corner first.

19:09.750 --> 19:11.250
<i>I don't know.</i>

19:09.750 --> 19:11.250
I don't know.

19:11.240 --> 19:13.100
Wh-What happened?

19:13.100 --> 19:15.380
Is he acting different now?

19:15.570 --> 19:18.860
Gobo. Gobo gobo bobobo.

19:16.340 --> 19:18.860
"Center. Take it first, and you can't lose."

19:18.860 --> 19:20.200
Oh, really?

19:20.200 --> 19:21.000
Gobo!

19:21.320 --> 19:23.200
Don't make friends with him.

19:23.200 --> 19:24.320
Gobo.

19:24.320 --> 19:26.510
So what do we do with him?

19:32.040 --> 19:35.890
<i>I don't know. I don't know. I don't know.</i>

19:35.890 --> 19:38.400
You guys, watch out!

19:38.400 --> 19:43.670
Th-That lady's really da-dange—

19:44.200 --> 19:45.440
He froze?

19:45.440 --> 19:46.780
What's his problem?!

19:46.780 --> 19:48.370
The signal came from here.

19:48.720 --> 19:50.690
It's cofficers. Let's go!

19:58.120 --> 20:00.960
Aren't things a little too quiet?

20:00.960 --> 20:03.080
Gobo bobobo gobo?

20:03.080 --> 20:04.750
"Isn't anybody here?"

20:04.750 --> 20:07.090
Or maybe they were all caught?

20:07.390 --> 20:08.540
It's Otaku Hero!

20:08.540 --> 20:09.880
Hey, they're back!

20:09.880 --> 20:11.360
They're home!

20:09.880 --> 20:11.360
Otaku Hero!

20:12.010 --> 20:14.270
Guys! You're all okay!

20:14.270 --> 20:16.600
Yeah. We beat 'em, you know.

20:16.600 --> 20:18.030
All thanks to Nick!

20:18.030 --> 20:20.240
<i>What took you so long, Otaku Hero?</i>

20:20.240 --> 20:24.410
<i>Thanks to your little pep talk,
we were able to fight SSC off!</i>

20:24.410 --> 20:26.710
You did great, guys!

20:26.710 --> 20:30.920
With our second win in Nakano
and the successful defense of Akiba,

20:30.920 --> 20:33.040
we're definitely one
step closer to revolution!

20:33.280 --> 20:34.910
<i>So while we're at it,</i>

20:34.910 --> 20:38.800
<i>you wanna send the Revolutionary Otaku
Army's message around the country?</i>

20:39.080 --> 20:41.800
Send our message? But how?

20:41.800 --> 20:43.520
<i>We hold a big event!</i>

20:43.520 --> 20:47.180
<i>We'll stream it across the country and
show it to the closeted otaku, the normies,</i>

20:47.180 --> 20:48.880
<i>and everyone else!</i>

20:48.880 --> 20:50.560
Whoa!

20:50.560 --> 20:51.960
An event?

20:51.960 --> 20:52.720
<i>Yeah!</i>

20:52.720 --> 20:56.990
<i>I'll use all my connections, and we'll
all make it the biggest event ever.</i>

20:56.990 --> 20:59.720
<i>We'll show them the otaku
fire is still burning!</i>

20:59.720 --> 21:02.360
<i>We'll show those SSC jerks!</i>

21:02.360 --> 21:04.570
Nick, you know that's...

21:04.570 --> 21:06.070
<i>Oh. No good?</i>

21:06.070 --> 21:07.830
...a really great idea!

21:14.730 --> 21:20.290
These videos have gone viral, and are
spreading faster than we can delete them.

21:20.290 --> 21:24.350
Perhaps we should try
to understand the otaku better.

21:24.350 --> 21:25.930
Just trying to suppress them is becoming more and more...

21:25.930 --> 21:27.300
That's enough.

21:28.220 --> 21:33.180
We can't let the otaku—
the rebel army roam free anymore.

21:33.430 --> 21:36.420
I look forward to seeing
the results of your work.

21:41.550 --> 21:44.100
<i>So what do we call the event?</i>

21:44.100 --> 21:45.520
How about this?

21:51.490 --> 21:54.950
<b>Wanku</b>

23:25.880 --> 23:27.680
Lyrics you can't shake,

23:27.680 --> 23:29.350
a groove that shakes your hips.

23:29.350 --> 23:31.490
The set list is a squeeze.

23:31.490 --> 23:33.510
How's that Kool-Aid tastin'?

23:33.510 --> 23:35.650
In an ideological reality,

23:35.650 --> 23:37.570
a magical concert stage

23:37.570 --> 23:39.970
appears like a mirage.
